nerated maze. The game combines the depth of a RogueLike game with a thrilling perma-death experience. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973450/extras/e1d026a1c074cac9d637c618e3c7cf74.poster.avif?t=1619088916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973450/extras/e1d026a1c074cac9d637c618e3c7cf74.webm?t=1619088916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973450/extras/e1d026a1c074cac9d637c618e3c7cf74.mp4?t=1619088916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>\u2022 Explore: </strong>The game is full of unreachable and hidden areas, but players have the opportunity to master new skills and acquire new items at any time in the game. These new abilities will help players explore further to discover treasures and secrets hidden within the maze. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973450/extras/ce73eec61676ceaa9168b2dc6b75e5a5.poster.avif?t=1619088916\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973450/extras/ce73eec61676ceaa9168b2dc6b75e5a5.webm?t=1619088916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973450/extras/ce73eec61676ceaa9168b2dc6b75e5a5.mp4?t=1619088916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>\u2022 Stimulating Combat: </strong>A wide selection of melee and ranged weaponry allow for multiple styles of play and create a unique combat experience.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/973450/extras/242aadc9f7bffeba82d911f9bb4fcda2.poster.avif?t=161908